INSERT INTO game_translations (game_id, language_code, title, description) SELECT id, 'en', 'Champ Manager 2006', 'First, an apology. We intended to deliver these words somewhat earlier, back when we covered Football Manager Handheld. Both games are, after all, football management sims based on popular PC forebears and revised for PSP, both were released around the same time, and indeed we started our reviewing in tandem.
